<script setup>import { computed,onMounted,ref } from 'vue';import { showSuccessToast } from 'vant';import { api } from '../api/ehr';const today=ref(null),history=ref([]),loading=ref(false),now=ref(new Date());const date=computed(()=>now.value.toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{month:'long',day:'numeric',weekday:'long'}));const time=x=>x?.slice(11,16)||'--:--';async function load(){[today.value,history.value]=await Promise.all([api.attendanceToday(),api.attendanceHistory()])}async function punch(type){loading.value=true;try{today.value=type==='in'?await api.checkIn():await api.checkOut();showSuccessToast(type==='in'?'签到成功':'签退成功');await load()}finally{loading.value=false}}onMounted(()=>{load();setInterval(()=>now.value=new Date(),1000)})</script>
<template><div class="page safe-top"><van-nav-bar title="考勤打卡" left-arrow @click-left="$router.back()"/><section class="clock brand-gradient"><div class="date">{{date}}</div><div class="time">{{now.toLocaleTimeString('zh-CN',{hour12:false})}}</div><div class="place"><van-icon name="location-o"/> 当前考勤范围</div></section><section class="card punch"><div class="point"><i :class="{done:today?.checkInTime}"></i><div><b>上班签到 09:00</b><p>{{today?.checkInTime ? `已签到 ${time(today.checkInTime)}`:'尚未签到'}}</p></div></div><div class="line"></div><div class="point"><i :class="{done:today?.checkOutTime}"></i><div><b>下班签退 18:00</b><p>{{today?.checkOutTime ? `已签退 ${time(today.checkOutTime)}`:'尚未签退'}}</p></div></div><button v-if="!today?.checkInTime" class="action-btn" :disabled="loading" @click="punch('in')">立即签到</button><button v-else-if="!today?.checkOutTime" class="action-btn" :disabled="loading" @click="punch('out')">立即签退</button><button v-else class="action-btn complete" disabled>今日打卡已完成</button></section><h2 class="section-title">最近记录</h2><section v-for="item in history" :key="item.id" class="record card"><div><b>{{item.workDate}}</b><p class="muted">签到 {{time(item.checkInTime)}} · 签退 {{time(item.checkOutTime)}}</p></div><span class="tag">{{item.status==='LATE'?'迟到':'正常'}}</span></section></div></template>
<style scoped>.van-nav-bar{background:transparent;margin:-8px -16px 14px}.clock{text-align:center;padding:24px;border-radius:22px}.date{opacity:.8}.time{font-size:40px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:2px;margin:8px}.place{font-size:12px;opacity:.75}.punch{padding:24px}.point{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}.point i{width:12px;height:12px;border:3px solid #b5c2c5;border-radius:50%;margin-top:4px}.point i.done{border-color:#20a399;background:#20a399}.point p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#8a9a9f;font-size:13px}.line{height:30px;border-left:2px dashed #d9e0e2;margin-left:5px}.action-btn{margin-top:24px}.complete{background:#9cb0b4}.record{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.record p{margin:7px 0 0}</style>
